This letter serves as a formal second request regarding a dispute I previously filed related to inaccurate late payment information reported on my credit report. 

Despite my earlier efforts to resolve this directly with the credit reporting agencies and the data furnisher, the account in question continues to be inaccurately reported. I am now requesting that the CFPB conduct a thorough investigation in accordance with the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) and hold the furnishers and credit reporting agencies accountable for failing to properly verify or correct the inaccurate information. 
